      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        80.14361572265625,
        123.51139831542969,
        109.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "1. I",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        123.87129974365234,
        87.01241302490234,
        251.61849975585938,
        107.23960876464844
      ],
      "text": "ntroduction",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        125.08363342285156,
        130.37139892578125,
        141.93963623046875
      ],
      "text": "1.1\t C",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        129.09043884277344,
        235.6632537841797,
        140.88963317871094
      ],
      "text": "hapter objectives",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        145.963134765625,
        513.3800659179688,
        159.31463623046875
      ],
      "text": "This chapter outlines the purpose and the target audience of the second edition of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        161.89065551757812,
        513.3800048828125,
        175.3111572265625
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for national tuberculosis programmes on the management of tuberculosis in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        177.88717651367188,
        513.4144287109375,
        191.30767822265625
      ],
      "text": "children.  It discusses the difference between TB in children and adolescents and TB in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        193.95269775390625,
        394.573486328125,
        207.30419921875
      ],
      "text": "adults and provides an estimate of the burden of childhood TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        223.12220764160156,
        322.4815673828125,
        239.97821044921875
      ],
      "text": "1.2\t P  TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        129.8032989501953,
        227.12901306152344,
        390.0704040527344,
        238.92820739746094
      ],
      "text": "urpose of the guidance for in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        244.001708984375,
        513.391357421875,
        257.35321044921875
      ],
      "text": "National tuberculosis control programmes (NTPs), paediatricians and health workers",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        259.99822998046875,
        513.44921875,
        273.3497314453125
      ],
      "text": "require guidance on the management of TB in children and of children living in families",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        275.9947509765625,
        513.4606323242188,
        289.34625244140625
      ],
      "text": "affected by TB. Important differences in the management of childhood TB and adult TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        291.99127197265625,
        222.22288513183594,
        305.3427734375
      ],
      "text": "are described in section 1.4.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        316.49774169921875,
        513.4835815429688,
        329.8492431640625
      ],
      "text": "The first edition of the guidance, published in 2006, has proved important in supporting",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        332.4942321777344,
        513.483642578125,
        345.8457336425781
      ],
      "text": "NTPs in low- and middle-income settings in the development or revision of their national",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        348.49072265625,
        513.4376220703125,
        361.84222412109375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines on management of childhood TB. Since 2006, WHO has published many",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        364.4872131347656,
        513.4721069335938,
        377.8387145996094
      ],
      "text": "recommendations relevant to the management of children with TB or TB/HIV and of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        380.48370361328125,
        513.4374389648438,
        393.835205078125
      ],
      "text": "children living in families affected by TB and HIV; this second edition of the childhood TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        396.4801940917969,
        462.91796875,
        409.8316955566406
      ],
      "text": "guidance has now compiled all relevant recommendations in one document.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        420.9866943359375,
        513.46044921875,
        434.33819580078125
      ],
      "text": "This updated guidance aims to improve case-finding and treatment outcomes, as well",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        436.9831848144531,
        365.5933837890625,
        450.3346862792969
      ],
      "text": "as the recording and reporting of child TB cases by NTPs.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        472.37261962890625,
        128.81739807128906,
        489.2286071777344
      ],
      "text": "1.3\t T",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        129.0334014892578,
        476.37939453125,
        220.98306274414062,
        488.1786193847656
      ],
      "text": "arget audience",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        493.2521057128906,
        513.3914794921875,
        506.6036071777344
      ],
      "text": "The purpose of this document is to provide guidance to NTPs, paediatricians and other",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        509.24859619140625,
        513.448974609375,
        522.60009765625
      ],
      "text": "health workers, including the private-for-profit sector, as well as to nongovernmental",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        525.2450561523438,
        513.4490356445312,
        538.5965576171875
      ],
      "text": "organizations and other civil society organizations, on the implementation and scaling-up",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        541.2415771484375,
        513.426025390625,
        554.5930786132812
      ],
      "text": "of childhood TB prevention, care and control activities. The recommendations contained",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        557.2380981445312,
        513.4835205078125,
        570.589599609375
      ],
      "text": "in this guidance also have important implications for the strategic directions and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        573.2345581054688,
        513.4605712890625,
        586.5860595703125
      ],
      "text": "activities of both maternal and child health programmes and HIV services. Distribution",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        589.2310791015625,
        513.4719848632812,
        602.5825805664062
      ],
      "text": "of the document will be done through the WHO country offices and the childhood TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        605.2276000976562,
        137.89340209960938,
        618.5791015625
      ],
      "text": "subgroup.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        629.7340698242188,
        513.4835815429688,
        643.0855712890625
      ],
      "text": "Like the 2006 edition, this document is targeted at low- and middle-income countries",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        645.7305908203125,
        513.4950561523438,
        659.0820922851562
      ],
      "text": "with a medium to high burden of TB; it is not intended to provide recommendations for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        661.7271118164062,
        513.4719848632812,
        675.07861328125
      ],
      "text": "high-income countries with low TB prevalence. This distinction is especially important in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        677.7235717773438,
        348.1018981933594,
        691.0750732421875
      ],
      "text": "the diagnostic approach and in contact investigation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        702.2301025390625,
        513.3915405273438,
        715.5816040039062
      ],
      "text": "The guidance is designed to inform the development and/or revision of national",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        718.2265625,
        513.4029541015625,
        731.5780639648438
      ],
      "text": "guidelines to ensure that children with TB infection and disease are identified early",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        734.2230834960938,
        513.3914794921875,
        747.5745849609375
      ],
      "text": "and managed effectively on the basis of the best available evidence. It should facilitate",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        750.2196044921875,
        513.4490356445312,
        763.5711059570312
      ],
      "text": "the implementation and scaling-up of current policies and activities, such as those that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        766.216064453125,
        513.4258422851562,
        779.5675659179688
      ],
      "text": "relate to contact investigation and isoniazid preventive therapy (IPT), and reduce the gap",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        782.2125854492188,
        225.6038818359375,
        795.5640869140625
      ],
      "text": "between policy and practice.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "11",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}